msgid "A package registers a source under the <code>%(group)s</code> entry-point group. A plugin appears as soon as it is installed, in every part of this instance and without a restart. Entry points are all it can bring: a plugin with pages or tables of its own has to be built into the image. A source that fails to load is logged and left out, and the built-in ones keep working."
msgstr "Sebuah paket mendaftarkan sumber di bawah grup entry point <code>%(group)s</code>. Plugin muncul segera setelah dipasang, di setiap bagian instans ini dan tanpa memulai ulang. Hanya entry point yang dapat dibawanya: plugin yang memiliki halaman atau tabel sendiri harus dibangun ke dalam image. Sumber yang gagal dimuat dicatat di log dan tidak disertakan, dan sumber bawaan tetap berfungsi."

