#: src/postulo/templates/help/your_details.html
#, fuzzy
msgid "Each part has a question mark of its own, beside its title, with one sentence about it when you rest on it and the whole of its help when you press it. <em>Save</em> at the bottom keeps everything you changed; removing a saved row asks first and takes effect at once."
