#: src/postulo/templates/partials/web_links.html
msgid "Paste an address without choosing a service and saving chooses it, where the address is on one Postulo knows. “Other” takes any address, and a name: left blank, the name is the address's host. Postulo never opens a link on its own — not to check it, not for a picture."
